<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="bn" dir="ltr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>লগইন — লেখক ফোরাম অ্যাডমিন</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/fonts.css?v=<%= AV %>" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" />
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Kalpurush', 'HindSiliguri', sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(700px 340px at 85% -10%, rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.10), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(600px 300px at -10% 110%, rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.08), transparent 60%),
        #f0f2f5;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      padding: 20px;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    h1, h2, h3, label { font-family: 'HindSiliguri', sans-serif; }
    .login-card {
      background: white; border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 40px 36px 30px;
      max-width: 420px; width: 100%;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(28, 30, 33, 0.12), 0 2px 8px rgba(28, 30, 33, 0.06);
      border: 1px solid #e4e6eb;
      position: relative;
      animation: cardIn 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.21, 1.02, 0.73, 1) both;
    }
    @keyframes cardIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px) scale(0.98); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
    .logo { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .logo .emblem {
      width: 60px; height: 60px;
      margin: 0 auto 14px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0aa56d, #047857);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.5rem; color: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.32);
    }
    .login-card h1 { color: #1c1e21; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 1.6rem; text-align: center; }
    .login-card p.sub { color: #65676b; margin-bottom: 26px; font-size: 0.88rem; text-align: center; line-height: 1.6; }
    .form-group { margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .form-group label { display: block; margin-bottom: 7px; color: #1c1e21; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.88rem; }
    .input-wrap { position: relative; }
    .input-wrap > i {
      position: absolute; left: 14px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);
      color: #8a8d93; font-size: 0.9rem; pointer-events: none;
    }
    .form-group input {
      width: 100%; padding: 12px 14px 12px 40px;
      border: 1px solid #ccd0d5; border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 0.98rem; font-family: inherit; color: #1c1e21;
      background: #ffffff; transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }
    .form-group input:focus { outline: none; border-color: #059669; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.14); }
    .btn-login {
      width: 100%; padding: 13px; margin-top: 6px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0aa56d, #047857);
      color: white; border: none; border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 9px;
      transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.2s, filter 0.2s;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.3);
    }
    .btn-login:hover { filter: brightness(1.08); transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .btn-login:active { transform: scale(0.98); }
    .error {
      background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b;
      padding: 11px 14px; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-size: 0.88rem; border: 1px solid #fecaca;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;
      animation: shake 0.4s ease;
    }
    @keyframes shake { 20% { transform: translateX(-6px); } 45% { transform: translateX(5px); } 70% { transform: translateX(-3px); } 90% { transform: translateX(2px); } }
    .login-foot {
      margin-top: 24px; padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px dashed #e4e6eb;
      text-align: center; color: #8a8d93; font-size: 0.76rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .login-foot a { color: #059669; font-weight: 600; }
    .back-home { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-top: 10px; }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { *, *::before, *::after { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="login-card">
    <div class="logo">
      <div class="emblem"><i class="fas fa-feather-alt"></i></div>
      <h1>অ্যাডমিন লগইন</h1>
      <p class="sub">লেখক ফোরাম, চট্টগ্রাম বিশ্ববিদ্যালয়<br>কন্টেন্ট ও কমিউনিটি ব্যবস্থাপনা প্যানেল</p>
    </div>
    <% if (error) { %><div class="error"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle"></i> <%= error %></div><% } %>
    <form method="POST">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="username">ব্যবহারকারী নাম</label>
        <div class="input-wrap">
          <i class="fas fa-user"></i>
          <input type="text" id="username" name="username" required autofocus autocomplete="username">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="password">পাসওয়ার্ড</label>
        <div class="input-wrap">
          <i class="fas fa-lock"></i>
          <input type="password" id="password" name="password" required autocomplete="current-password">
        </div>
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn-login"><i class="fas fa-sign-in-alt"></i> প্রবেশ করুন</button>
    </form>
    <div class="login-foot">
      © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> লেখক ফোরাম — সর্বস্বত্ব সংরক্ষিত<br>
      <a href="/" class="back-home"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> মূল সাইটে ফিরে যান</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
